**/target/
*.class
*.jar
*.war
*.ear
*.logs
.flattened-pom.xml

# Node & Frontend Build Output
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/dist-ssr/
**/build/
**/coverage/
*.local

# IDE & Editor Settings
.idea/
*.iml
.vscode/
*.suo
*.ntvs*
